<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line ltx_pruned_first">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">LiLo-VLA: Compositional Long-Horizon Manipulation via Linked Object-Centric Policies</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Yue Yang
