</span><span class="ltx_author_notes"><span class="ltx_author_notes_content">
<span class="ltx_contact ltx_role_affiliation"><span class="ltx_contact_name">Affiliation: </span><span id="id4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Carnegie Mellon University<sup id="id4.1" class="ltx_sup"><span id="id4.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium">†</span></sup></span>Corresponding author: <span id="id5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">yygx@cs.unc.edu</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span class="ltx_author_before">  </span><span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
